DESCRIPTION:ON SALE NOW Cat Country 98.1 presents Jacob Hackworth LIVE at 
 Moonshine Alley on Tuesday\, August 25th! MCA Records &amp\; Nashville sin
 ger and songwriter Jacob Hackworth is coming to Providence for one night o
 nly! Jacob is one of country music’s fastest-rising talents\, from his s
 ongwriting success (including Tucker Wetmore’s career-launching smash 
 “Wine Into Whiskey\,” and many more) to his debut country radio single
  as a recording artist\, “What Took You So Long.” Don’t miss his ama
 zing writing and live show at Moonshine Alley for one unforgettable night 
 Moonshine Alley - 52 Pine Street\, Providence\, RI Doors Open: 6:00 PM Sho
 w Starts with Pat Lowell: 7:00 PM Moonshine Alley will offer a limited men
 u during the show. This is a 21+ event!\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodei
 sland.com/event/jacob-hackworth-live-at-moonshine-alley!/111051/
LOCATION:Moonshine Alley\, 52 Pine St\, Providence\, RI 02903
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/jacob-hackworth-live-at-moonshi
 ne-alley!/111051/
END:VEVENT
