 ation of all the greats of weird fiction\, old and new\, including predece
 ssors and contemporaries of Providence’s H.P. Lovecraft and the many aut
 hors and artists who have forged their own paths of weird. Visit website f
 or more information and updates for another incredible convention and fest
 ival. Providence welcomes you all.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland
 .com/event/necronomicon-providence/84602/
LOCATION:Various Venues \, Providence\, RI 02903 Time: see website
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/necronomicon-providence/84602/
END:VEVENT
