BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Willy Wonka Jr.
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260815
DTSTAMP:20260812T112646Z
UID:a5e49a0a0720ec778da40a452ea2@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Step into a world of pure imagination with Willy Wonka Jr. ! J
 oin Charlie Bucket as he embarks on a magical adventure through Willy Wonk
 a’s whimsical chocolate factory\, filled with quirky characters\, dazzli
 ng inventions\, and sweet surprises at every turn. This delightful musical
  adaptation brings Roald Dahl’s beloved story to life with catchy songs\
 , colorful sets\, and a heartwarming tale of kindness\, courage\, and the 
 magic of believing in your dreams. Perfect for audiences of all ages!\n\nS
 ource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/willy-wonka-jr/108276/
LOCATION:Granite Theatre\, 1 Granite Street\, Westerly\, RI 02891
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/willy-wonka-jr/108276/
END:VEVENT
